# Agents merge their own PRs here once CI is green, so the blast radius of a
# bad change is bounded by this file rather than by review habits.
#
# These paths are the ones where a wrong change is invisible in a green build:
# the contracts every work package is written against, the tests that decide
# what "green" means, and the workflows that decide what runs at all. A test
# suite that can be edited by the same actor it constrains is not a constraint.

